{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>From the hand of Sheol</b> — I would have redeemed your fathers; now I will be your plague of death, and I will be your קטב. The witness: 'in darkness he walks' (from קטב in the sense of הכרתה). Some say: אהי is like איה, as they said: 'we made a covenant with death.'" "<b>נוחם</b> — a noun, from the root of 'and YHWH relented'; the meaning is that I will not relent."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:12.248950231Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}